        "original_id": "3af3719a-9a3b-5ccc-9e9a-177572a7a268",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Imran Khan, Mansoor Khan, Kangana Ranaut, Sayani Palit, Shankar-Ehsaan-Loy\n- Films: Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak, Jo Jeeta Wohi Sikander, Katti Batti\n- Topics: child acting, playback singing, Bollywood, Tollywood\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, Imran Khan appeared as a child artist in the film Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak.\n- In 1988, Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak, also known as QSQT, was released as an Indian Hindi-language romantic drama film directed by Mansoor Khan.\n- In 1992, Imran Khan appeared as a child artist in the film Jo Jeeta Wohi Sikander.\n- In 2015, Sayani Palit made her Bollywood debut by singing Ove Janiye Reprise for Katti Batti under the direction of Shankar-Ehsaan-Loy.\n- Katti Batti stars Kangana Ranaut and Imran Khan in the lead roles.",
